{"title": "Rally, Then A Pause", "type": "Technical lesson", "hooks": ["A sharp rally, then a quiet pause. Here's what it might mean.", "Nobody tells you the pause matters more than the rally.", "This pause after a rally is a clue. Here's how to read it."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Nobody tells you the pause matters more than the rally.", "text": "Rally, then a pause", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 102], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The pole", "vo": "A bull flag starts with a sharp rally, the pole. Here, from 33.87 up to 34.82.", "show": 86, "cues": [{"say": "the pole", "do": "shade", "from": 69, "to": 75, "tone": "green"}, {"say": "33.87", "do": "mark", "i": 69, "label": "A", "side": "low", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "34.82", "do": "mark", "i": 75, "label": "B", "side": "high", "tone": "green"}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The flag", "vo": "Then a quiet drift lower on light volume, the flag. Here it eased back to 34.33.", "show": 86, "cues": [{"say": "the flag", "do": "shade", "from": 75, "to": 86, "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "34.33", "do": "mark", "i": 86, "label": "C", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The breakout", "vo": "When the price breaks out of the flag, the trend often continues. Here it pushed on to 34.92.", "show": 86, "cues": [{"say": "breaks out of the flag", "do": "line", "price": 34.82, "label": "flag top", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "pushed on", "do": "reveal", "to": 92}, {"say": "34.92", "do": "mark", "i": 92, "label": "D", "side": "high", "tone": "green"}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "When flags fail", "vo": "Flags fail too. Beware a drift too deep, or heavy volume on the pullback. A stop below the flag limits the damage.", "items": [{"text": "Drifts too deep", "sub": "the rally is being undone", "icon": "warn"}, {"text": "Heavy pullback volume", "sub": "sellers are not quiet", "icon": "warn"}, {"text": "Stop below flag", "sub": "limits the damage", "icon": "shield"}], "cues": [{"say": "a drift too deep", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "heavy volume", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "a stop below the flag", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Spot the next flag", "vo": "Practise spotting flags at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "A sharp rally, then a quiet pause. Here's what it might mean.\nA bull flag starts with a sharp rally, the pole, then a quiet drift lower on light volume, the flag.\nWhen the price breaks out of the flag, the trend often continues.\nFlags fail too: beware a drift too deep or heavy volume on the pullback. A stop below the flag limits the damage.\nSave this for your next chart.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n#MemeStreet #BullFlag #ChartPatterns #TechnicalAnalysis #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[34.12, 34.18, 34.08, 34.12, 3194], [34.12, 34.16, 34.09, 34.16, 4613], [34.15, 34.19, 34.12, 34.19, 4029], [34.19, 34.23, 34.18, 34.21, 3951], [34.21, 34.28, 34.2, 34.25, 7266], [34.25, 34.31, 34.19, 34.19, 2976], [34.2, 34.25, 34.15, 34.25, 4276], [34.25, 34.28, 34.2, 34.28, 3013], [34.27, 34.3, 34.24, 34.28, 4336], [34.28, 34.37, 34.28, 34.35, 2734], [34.35, 34.38, 34.28, 34.28, 3779], [34.29, 34.31, 34.26, 34.26, 5668], [34.27, 34.28, 34.24, 34.27, 6822], [34.26, 34.27, 34.12, 34.13, 3667], [34.11, 34.18, 34.08, 34.12, 3611], [34.11, 34.16, 34.06, 34.07, 3948], [34.07, 34.07, 34.05, 34.06, 1703], [34.05, 34.08, 34.05, 34.08, 1425], [34.08, 34.09, 34.08, 34.08, 920], [34.08, 34.08, 34.07, 34.07, 1177], [34.08, 34.1, 34.07, 34.09, 1287], [34.08, 34.09, 34.06, 34.07, 1639], [34.07, 34.07, 34.06, 34.06, 1795], [34.06, 34.07, 34.05, 34.07, 1476], [34.07, 34.07, 34.06, 34.06, 1968], [34.06, 34.06, 34.03, 34.05, 1381], [34.09, 34.16, 34.04, 34.04, 13434], [34.04, 34.08, 33.97, 34.04, 7395], [34.04, 34.16, 33.98, 34.16, 7274], [34.16, 34.27, 34.14, 34.22, 3122], [34.23, 34.23, 34.09